# Gateway: docs are canonical

For `paperclip/gateway/` and `docs/gateway/`:

- Each gateway module should have a one-line docstring pointing at its doc page (e.g. `See docs/gateway/cli.md`).
- Explain setup, env vars, algorithms, and engineering rationale in the matching `.md` file—not long comments or docstrings in code.
- When changing gateway behavior, update the doc and code together so the doc alone explains the file.
- Do not use `git status` to discover files; read the local filesystem.
